cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use FASTag, please cite this software release. Please also cite DirecTag (Tabb et al. 2008), whose algorithm FASTag reimplements, and OpenMS."
title: "FASTag: a fast parallel sequence tagger and tag-based filter for peptide MS/MS spectra"
abstract: >-
  FASTag derives partial sequence tags from peptide tandem mass spectra and keeps only the spectra,
  proteins or species whose tags occur in sequences the user supplies. It reimplements the DirecTag
  algorithm as a parallel OpenMS TOPP tool with bounded memory, and ships as a command-line tool and a
  desktop app for macOS, Linux and Windows.
type: software
